    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6989d3ee6901c340",
      "translationZh": "TL;DR：我构建了一个包含 1,451 道难题的数据集，所有题目均来自 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 的全正确、最大努力推理轨迹。每条轨迹均通过确定性的 sympy 评分器 + Qwen3.5-4B 评判器与黄金答案进行验证，并且该数据集使用 Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B 对 MATH-500 和 993 道 AIME 题目进行了去污染。该数据集专为小型推理模型的 SFT/蒸馏而设计。MIT 许可证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0acfddc2eef56509",
      "translationZh": "总计 11.6M，每条轨迹平均约 8.0k（最大 119k）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c156c399818fb722",
      "translationZh": "AoPS 论坛 (1,002) + MATH 数据集 (449)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bccbe4b4a3391bd",
      "translationZh": "代数 389，应用数学 296，几何 276，数论 255，离散数学 139，微积分 46，预备微积分 26，+ 其他",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a7b3d662d177cf2",
      "translationZh": "代码评分器 (sympy) + 2-pass SLM 评判器；错误/歧义的轨迹被排除",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cfa4940244e2c66",
      "translationZh": "MATH-500 (cos ≥ 0.94) + 993 题 AIME 参考 (1983–2026)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ab08ad8b3a2dfa9",
      "translationZh": "父级：来自 SynthLabsAI/Big-Math-RL-Verified 的 53,740 道竞赛来源问题（MATH、奥林匹克、AoPS 论坛、HARP、Omni-MATH、AMC/AIME）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "979e0b9565f676e7",
      "translationZh": "清洗：精确去重，嵌入近似去重（cos ≥ 0.95），质量过滤（缺失图片、散文答案、残留）→ 保留 49,387 个问题，丢弃 4,353 个。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1cf03d2f12ce0a2d",
      "translationZh": "选择：仅保留可验证的闭式答案，排除基准相关来源（omnimath, amc_aime, HARP 被排除），难度段 llama8b_solve_rate ≤ 0.2 → 得到 5,681 个样本池 → 按 (source × domain) 分层抽取 2,000 个样本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3a5398980bdb83d",
      "translationZh": "生成：使用 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash，最大推理力度。约 9 分钟内产生 18.1M 推理 token，并发度 2500（该 API 极其快速 — — 208 tok/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b0688c9f1fb21bb6",
      "translationZh": "验证：见下文。1,537 道正确（在此难度段 pass@1 为 78.5%），370 道错误，50 道模糊 → 仅正确集合会被发布。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ccf3cc9272378a98",
      "translationZh": "去污染：删除与 AIME 题目匹配的痕迹 → 1,451 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8ce6e0a01c835f1",
      "translationZh": "两层，均必需：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1be74333f2872b0",
      "translationZh": "代码评分器：基于 sympy 的框选答案与标准答案的归一化（分数、根号、集合、单位、小数容忍度）。直接匹配 1,462/1,957。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9f29017327439f2",
      "translationZh": "SLM 评判器：将 495 个评分器不匹配的案例送至本地运行的 Qwen3.5-4B（UD-Q4_K_XL 量化，llama.cpp）进行评估。Pass 1 对比答案：其中 78 实际上等价（被挽回），420 不同。此外，将评分器匹配的 150 行样本也送给评判器作为假阳性校准（147 同意，3 被标记 → 人工复审；发现并修复了 3 个评分器 alnum 错误）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2ef1ce5dc3d9ca3",
      "translationZh": "Net：法官只负责救援，从不盖章。如果有什么错误的话，发布倾向于丢弃正确的痕迹。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b57109735b19ca58",
      "translationZh": "所有嵌入向量均使用 Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B Q8_0、4096-d、llama.cpp :",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5dc4162b54690e1",
      "translationZh": "MATH-500：清理后的池在 cos ≥ 0.94 时被检查 → 33 行被删除（+2 字符串匹配）。阈值根据审计对进行校准：精确匹配对 0.9995，重复改写对 0.95–0.99，模板双生体（答案不同）0.92–0.96。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f860ef2c00e9f2c2",
      "translationZh": "AIME：最终追踪集与 993 题参考（1983–2024 + 2025 + 2026 I/II）以及 HARP-增强的补充进行对比，采用原始问题文本的精确字符串 + 余弦相似度。层级：精确匹配（找到 34 个），cos ≥ 0.96（42 个），0.88–0.96（7 个），0.85–0.88（1 个，已审查）。删除了 86 条追踪。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49d0cbb6a48bf8af",
      "translationZh": "答案已验证，但步骤未验证。最终答案与金标准匹配；CoT 本身未逐行审计。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d38277b2d78f0d58",
      "translationZh": "单一教师。所有追踪均来自 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash，因此具有风格一致性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b2c781587cb5425",
      "translationZh": "Near-dedup 是近似的。嵌入余弦阈值已校准，但不是证明。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37498e359159e12b",
      "translationZh": "Gold answers 继承自父数据集。少量可能有误。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "474cae557694381c",
      "translationZh": "SFT / 蒸馏目标用于推理模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c93dd80ccb922dcc",
      "translationZh": "长距离推理评估: 87 条轨迹，思考标记 >30k，最大 119k",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
